WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.810
Why do hand warmers get hot?

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:08.270
Inside, iron reacts with oxygen.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.190
That reaction gives out heat.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:14.500
Reactions that release heat are exothermic.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.540
Some reactions take heat in and feel cold.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.013
Those are endothermic.
